2026-10-15T16:53:27.7043834Z     ✓ 3. Empty submission response updates lastSyncAt to prevent rapid polling spinning (6 ms)
2026-10-15T16:53:27.7044564Z     ✓ 4. Full idempotency on repeat sync with identical submissions (14 ms)
2026-10-15T16:53:27.7045429Z     ✓ 5. Foreign sample collision strictly avoids mutation, reports FOREIGN_SCOPE_COLLISION, and halts cursor (22 ms)
2026-10-15T16:53:27.7046358Z     ✓ 6. Duplicate branch enforces commit gates and rolls back transaction on revoked config (26 ms)
2026-10-15T16:53:27.7047434Z     ✓ 7. Conflict replay idempotency: repeating the conflicting submission does not append duplicate entries or duplicate audit rows (28 ms)
2026-10-15T16:53:27.7048570Z     ✓ 8. Case-insensitive lookup preserves evidence on lowercase existing record in DB, advancing cursor cleanly (12 ms)
2026-10-15T16:53:27.7049744Z     ✓ 9. Ambiguous depth identity retains a durable hold through physical arrival and blocks acceptance (73 ms)
2026-10-15T16:53:27.7050711Z     ✓ 10. Unchanged original primary replay causes zero metadata, audit, or hold changes (12 ms)
2026-10-15T16:53:27.7051824Z     ✓ 11. Cross-form occurrences with same kobo_id and depth are preserved and not silently deduplicated (31 ms)
